<title>PHILIPPINES: Seafront sets 15 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Seafront sets 15 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine oil explorer Seafront Resources Corp had declared a 15 percent stock dividend to be given to shareholders as of February 10, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date has been set on January 30.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
